{"schema":1,"id":"2password","title":"Can an agent use a key it never sees?","lang":"en","sources":["https://github.com/kitlangton/2password/blob/e011177d3e35f97a580b8903df6fff7e02593d16/src/discover.ts","https://github.com/kitlangton/2password/blob/e011177d3e35f97a580b8903df6fff7e02593d16/src/op.ts","https://github.com/kitlangton/2password/blob/e011177d3e35f97a580b8903df6fff7e02593d16/README.md","https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secret-references/","https://developer.1password.com/docs/service-accounts/use-with-1password-cli/"],"settings":[{"id":"auth","label":"Authenticate with","default":"desktop","options":[{"value":"desktop","label":"Desktop approvals"},{"value":"service","label":"Service account"}]}],"answer":"The agent handles only an op:// reference, and op puts the value into the app’s environment","checks":[{"question":"The agent searches for “databse”, which no title contains. What does find return, and why that item?","answer":"A suggestion, the Database reference. “databse” is one edit from “database”, so it scores 1 − 1/8 = 0.875, above the 0.6 threshold."},{"question":"The app prints API_KEY to stdout, and the agent reads stdout. Does passing a reference prevent that disclosure?","answer":"No. The app receives the resolved key and can print it. References keep field values out of find’s output and the launch request; they do not sandbox the app or redact its output."},{"question":"Does knowing an op:// reference let an unauthenticated process read that credential?","answer":"No. The reference names a location but supplies no authorization. An authenticated op process with the required access must resolve it."}],"cases":[{"values":{"auth":"desktop"},"name":"Authenticate with: Desktop approvals","duration":110.767,"paper":"#ffffff","steps":[{"step":"ask","title":"An agent must start an app with a key it should never read","line":"what could the agent pass along instead of the key?","caption":"The app needs API_KEY in its environment. Printing that value for the agent would also put it into the conversation, though the agent needs only to choose the credential and start the app. What can name the credential without exposing its value?","start":0,"end":15.767,"hold":0.567,"state":{"reader":{"needs":"API_KEY","agentHasValue":false}},"changed":{"reader":{"after":{"needs":"API_KEY","agentHasValue":false}}},"picture":"Agent. ?. Application. needs API_KEY. must not read. the value.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│     ┌──────────────────────┐       ┌─────────────────────┐        ┌─────────────────────┐\n│     │                      │       │                     │        │                     │\n│     │        Agent         ────────▶          ?          ─────────▶     Application     │\n│     └──────────────────────┘       └─────────────────────┘        └─────────────────────┘\n│\n│            must not read                                             needs API_KEY\n│\n│\n│              the value\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│"},{"step":"reader-boundary","title":"Answer: hand over a reference, and let op swap in the value","line":"The agent passes op://Personal/Cloud API/credential; op gives its value to the app.","caption":"The agent handles only an op:// reference, and op puts the value into the app’s environment. The reference names a vault, item and field without containing the key. Authenticated op resolves that name when it starts the app. This keeps the value out of the launch request, but the app can still read or print its own environment.","start":15.767,"end":37.533,"hold":16.5,"state":{"reader":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true}},"changed":{"reader":{"before":{"needs":"API_KEY","agentHasValue":false},"after":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true}}},"picture":"Agent. op CLI. Application. op:// reference. secret value. op://Personal/Cloud API/credential.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                        op:// reference                  secret value\n│\n│     ┌──────────────────────┐       ┌─────────────────────┐        ┌─────────────────────┐\n│     │                      │       │                     │        │                     │\n│     │        Agent         ────────▶       op CLI        ─────────▶     Application     │\n│     └──────────────────────┘       └─────────────────────┘        └─────────────────────┘\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│                              op://Personal/Cloud API/credential\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│"},{"step":"boundary","title":"To pick a key, the agent searches titles, never values","line":"it asks for “cloud api” and the typo “databse”. What comes back?","caption":"Title matching chooses the items without needing their field values. Here “cloud api” and “databse” search 3 sample titles. The later item-get reply can contain secret values; the wrapper discards them before returning references to the agent.","start":37.533,"end":51.433,"hold":42.767,"state":{"reader":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true},"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}]},"changed":{"walks":{"after":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}]}},"picture":"Flowchart: 4 nodes, 3 links; Code, 4 lines. Travelled: Agent → 2password find; 2password find → op CLI; focused: 2: Cloud API API_CREDENTIAL Personal; 3: Cloud Login LOGIN Work; and 1 more.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌     ┌──────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐     ┌───────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐\n│  ▌     │  ────── ─│─────│  ─────────────  │─────││  ─────── │─────│  ─────────────── │\n│  ▌     │          │     │                 │     ││          │     │                  │\n│  ▌     └──────────┘     └─────────────────┘     └───────────┘     └──────────────────┘\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│\n│\n│\n│                        ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        │                                             │\n│                        │▌title         category        vault         │\n│                        │▌Cloud API     API_CREDENTIAL  Personal      │\n│                        │▌Cloud Login   LOGIN           Work          │\n│                        │▌                                            │\n│                        │▌Database      DATABASE        Work          │\n│                        └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│"},{"step":"match","title":"Answer: a match for “cloud api”, a suggestion for “databse”","line":"Cloud API contains every word of “cloud api”; Database is 1 edit from “databse”.","caption":"Cloud API contains the words in “cloud api”, so it matches. The typo “databse” has no match. Comparing its spelling with title words gives Database a score of 0.875, above the suggestion threshold. The fallback finds a likely name without comparing secret contents.","start":51.433,"end":67.567,"hold":53.533,"state":{"reader":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true},"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}],"matches":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]},"found":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]}},"changed":{"matches":{"after":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]}},"found":{"after":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]}}},"picture":"Flowchart: 4 nodes, 3 links; Code, 4 lines. Travelled: Agent → 2password find; 2password find → op CLI; focused: 2: Cloud API match 0.143; 3: Cloud Login no api 0.000; and 1 more. New in this step: Code, 4 lines.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌     ┌──────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐     ┌───────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐\n│  ▌     │  ────── ─│─────│  ─────────────  │─────││  ─────── │─────│  ─────────────── │\n│  ▌     │          │     │                 │     ││          │     │                  │\n│  ▌     └──────────┘     └─────────────────┘     └───────────┘     └──────────────────┘\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│\n│\n│\n│                  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                  │                                                         │\n│                  ▌ title         cloud api       databse: score ≥ 0.6      │\n│                  ▌ Cloud API     match           0.143                     │\n│                  ▌ Cloud Login   no api          0.000                     │\n│                  ▌                                                         │\n│                  ▌ Database      no cloud, api   0.875 suggested           │\n│                  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│"},{"step":"fetch","title":"One op item get fetches the match and the suggestion","line":"Item list, then one item get for Cloud API and Database; one approval.","caption":"find first lists titles, then fetches the selected items together. Upstream documents one desktop approval for this command. The agent still receives references rather than the secret-bearing item reply.","start":67.567,"end":78.467,"hold":71.267,"state":{"reader":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true},"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"A","to":"T","edge":"message:A->T#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#1"},{"step":"fetch","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#1"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"A","edge":"message:T->A#0"}],"matches":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]},"found":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]},"auth":"desktop"},"changed":{"walks":{"before":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"}],"after":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"A","to":"T","edge":"message:A->T#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#1"},{"step":"fetch","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#