││      │\n│                      │       └┘               └┘              └┘┘      │\n│                      │                                                 │\n│                      └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"step":"reference","title":"find returns references and prints no secret value","line":"One reference per query; every sample value is searched for in the output.","caption":"The returned strings identify a vault, item and field. Field values are discarded while the wrapper decodes op’s response. Those names let the agent select and launch the app without putting the key into the conversation; they do not themselves grant access to the vault.","start":78.467,"end":95.367,"hold":81.467,"state":{"reader":{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","agentHasValue":false,"childHasValue":true},"walks":[{"step":"boundary","from":"Agent","to":"Find","edge":"edge:Agent->Find#0"},{"step":"boundary","from":"Find","to":"Op","edge":"edge:Find->Op#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"A","to":"T","edge":"message:A->T#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#0"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"O","edge":"message:T->O#1"},{"step":"fetch","from":"O","to":"T","edge":"message:O->T#1"},{"step":"fetch","from":"T","to":"A","edge":"message:T->A#0"}],"matches":{"cloud api":["Cloud API"],"databse":[]},"found":{"opCalls":["item list --format json","item get - --format json"],"fetched":["Cloud API","Database"],"matches":[{"ref":"op://Personal/Cloud API/credential","title":"Cloud API","kind":"api-credential","queries":["cloud api"]}],"suggestions":[{"query":"databse","ref":"op://Work/Database/password","title":"Database","kind":"database"}]},"auth":"desktop"},"changed":{},"picture":"8 labels.","drawing":"┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│             match for “cloud api”\n│\n│                              